  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forest Conservation and Management Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to assist the Government of Tanzania (GOT) in implementing the forest policy by developing a framework for the long-term sustainable management and conservation of Tanzania?s forest resources, strengthening the role of individuals, communities, villages and private sector in management and conservation of forests, and implementing this framework on a pilot scale.</narrative>
  </description>
